      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/kramer_nebraska",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Kramer’s surrounding farmland mainly grows corn and soybeans, reflecting Nebraska’s prairie agricultural focus.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
